      "text": "⍉specific therapy: supportive, mainly nutrition incl vit A, D, E and K supp. Formula-fed infants: formula ↑ in medium-chain TG (better absorbed w bile salt deficiency). Some bile flow: ursodeoxycholic acid QD or BID may relieve itching, improve bile flow and possibly liver dz."
